@baseUrl = http://localhost:5188
@tenant = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@subscription = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@plan = replace-with-reviewed-plan-id
@csrf = {{session.response.body.$.csrfToken}}

### Host-only health; no SQL, Azure, or model request
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Establish local browser session (retain cookies in your HTTP client)
# @name session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session

### Measured dependencies and SDK authentication; no inference
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Copilot authentication and models only; no migration preflight or inference
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/copilot/status

### Current browser's sign-in attempt; code is local-only and must not be shared
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/copilot/signin

### Explicit GitHub device sign-in; authorize manually on GitHub, not in this file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/copilot/signin
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Container discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/containers

### Selected source metadata (privileged local credential remains in the host)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/databases
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"containerName":"sqldbcontainer"}

### Azure tenant discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure/tenants

### Azure subscription discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure/subscriptions?tenantId={{tenant}}

### Available regions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure/locations?tenantId={{tenant}}&subscriptionId={{subscription}}

### Existing resource groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure/groups?tenantId={{tenant}}&subscriptionId={{subscription}}

### Existing SQL servers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure/servers?tenantId={{tenant}}&subscriptionId={{subscription}}&resourceGroup=selected-group

### Current user in selected Azure tenant (separate from GitHub identity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/azure/identity?tenantId={{tenant}}&subscriptionId={{subscription}}

### Create review plan only: does not create resources
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "containerName":"sqldbcontainer",
  "sourceDatabase":"CustomerServiceDesk",
  "tenantId":"{{tenant}}",
  "subscriptionId":"{{subscription}}",
  "region":"eastus2",
  "resourceGroup":"selected-group",
  "createResourceGroup":false,
  "serverName":"selected-logical-server",
  "createServer":false,
  "targetDatabase":"CustomerServiceDesk",
  "authentication":"Entra"
}

### Read selected plan (404 with placeholder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{plan}}

### Negative approval example: MUST reject; replace only after reviewing exact resources
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{plan}}/run
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmation":"NOT APPROVED","writersStopped":false}

### Read durable state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{plan}}

### Explicit cancellation; no deletion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{plan}}/cancel
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Actual Copilot inference: executing this consumes account usage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/copilot/message
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Inspect readiness and migration status, then explain the next safe step.","model":"auto"}

### Event stream (long-lived connection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
